## Professional .NET Baseline Gitignore

# Build results and outputs
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Log]s/

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
packages/

# User-specific files and IDE configurations
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
.fleet/
.cr/

# CoreCLR and crash dumps
*.dump

# Local environment secrets (Always exclude sensitive data)
.env
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
